[35.884841, "o", "> "]
[35.884988, "o", "- Direct user mails to `/var/mail/<username>`. They will be accessed with `mailbox.mbox(f\"/var/mail/{username}\")`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
